CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_TwinsJoAndZoeIntro::
	.string "We’re going to protect ERIKA!$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_TwinsJoAndZoeDefeat::
	.string "Oh... We lost...$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_TwinsJoAndZoe::
	.string "ERIKA is much, much stronger!$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_PicnickerTanyaIntro::
	.string "Oh, a battle?\n"
	.string "That’s kind of scary, but OK!$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_PicnickerTanyaDefeat::
	.string "Oh, that’s it?$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_PicnickerTanya::
	.string "Oh, look at all your BADGES. No\n"
	.string "wonder I couldn’t win!$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_BeautyJuliaIntro::
	.string "Were you looking at these flowers\n"
	.string "or at me?$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_BeautyJuliaDefeat::
	.string "How annoying!$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_BeautyJulia::
	.string "How do I go about becoming ladylike\n"
	.string "like ERIKA?$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_LassMichelleIntro::
	.string "Wait! Only girls are allowed here!$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_LassMichelleDefeat::
	.string "Oh, bleah!$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_LassMichelle::
	.string "We don’t dislike boys or anything.\p"
	.string "But there are certain subjects\n"
	.string "that only girls can talk about.$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_LeaderErikaIntro::
	.string "ERIKA: Hello...\n"
	.string "Lovely weather, isn’t it?\l"
	.string "It’s so pleasant...\p"
	.string "...I’m afraid I may doze off...\p"
	.string "My name is ERIKA.\n"
	.string "I am the LEADER of CELADON GYM.\p"
	.string "...Oh? All the way from JOHTO, you\n"
	.string "say? How nice...\p"
	.string "Oh. I’m sorry, I didn’t realize\n"
	.string "that you wished to challenge me.\p"
	.string "Very well, but I shall not lose.$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_LeaderErikaDefeat::
	.string "ERIKA: Oh!\n"
	.string "I concede defeat...\p"
	.string "You are remarkably strong...\p"
	.string "I shall give you RAINBOWBADGE...\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the RAINBOWBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_LeaderErika_1::
	.string "ERIKA: Losing leaves a bitter\n"
	.string "aftertaste...\p"
	.string "But knowing that there are strong\n"
	.string "trainers spurs me to do better...$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_LeaderErika_2::
	.string "ERIKA: That was a delightful match.\p"
	.string "I felt inspired.\n"
	.string "Please, I wish you to have this TM.\p"
	.string "It is GIGA DRAIN.\p"
	.string "It is a wonderful move that drains\n"
	.string "half the damage it inflicts to heal\l"
	.string "your POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Please use it if it pleases you...$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_TwinsJoAndZoe2Intro::
	.string "We’ll show you POKéMON moves that\n"
	.string "ERIKA taught us!$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_TwinsJoAndZoe2::
	.string "ERIKA will get you back for us!$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "CELADON CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: ERIKA\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS: CARLOS ARD$"

CeladonCity_Interior13_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "CELADON CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: ERIKA\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS: CARLOS ARD\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}$"
